gear wielders attack the base, their powers are weakened by a strange red gas, and they are attacked by a monster which doesn't seem to be a Noise...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-07-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c0RZrvWivTSZIQaCo3WKDaao30p.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c0RZrvWivTSZIQaCo3WKDaao30p.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"1168881","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Maria and Tsubasa fight a battle on top of the Section 2 submarine. After Maria escapes, the wielders return for the school cultural fair. Chris is drafted into a singing competition, but just as she's about to win, a surprise challenger appears.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-07-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8Ij5YM450oQBcK1Afq7QiBUAQJb.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Ij5YM450oQBcK1Afq7QiBUAQJb.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"1168882","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kirika and Shirabe sing \"Orbital Beat\" at the school singing competition. Not wanting to fight them at the school, the wielders agree to fight a duel at another place. But when they arrive, instead of the girls they find Dr. Ver.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-08-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/46JUwVPsdbnr54gdOrXliRlk5H7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/46JUwVPsdbnr54gdOrXliRlk5H7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"1168883","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After being seriously injured by the Nephilim, Hibiki is unable to control her Symphogear. She flies into a rage, destroying the Nephilim and ripping out its heart. During the post-fight medical exam, it's discovered that if she continues to use her gear, she'll die.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-08-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eJabyL8HXAgHl8tQfXbIsNZM6uE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eJabyL8HXAgHl8tQfXbIsNZM6uE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"1168884","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kirika and Shirabe attempt to recover Dr. Ver so that he can treat their mom. They run into Hibiki, whose fusion has progressed to the point where she can touch a Noise with her bare hands. Dr. Ver injects them with a LiNKER boost, and they attempt to use their Superb Songs, which might kill them.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-08-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oT99a0KaPSLA7oMSIHDZbzfekGP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oT99a0KaPSLA7oMSIHDZbzfekGP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"1168885","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Moon is going to crash into the Earth, and there is no way to stop it. Finé's plan has been to raise the floating continent of Frontier in order to survive, but they lack the needed technology. They attempt to make a deal with the American government, which betrays them instead. Ver's Noise intervene to save them, but Hibiki is nearby, and she's forced to transform to survive.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-08-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fK7WrhOcHweHkD0DXSV1hq26fk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fK7WrhOcHweHkD0DXSV1hq26fk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/2/episode/8"},{"id":"1168886","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Miku is missing after the explosion at the Sky Tower, but there's hope she might still be alive. Despite the danger, the wielders decide to try and recover her from Finé's clutches.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-08-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fs1Oy0RUavI5sWjcwdM59vKYzka.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fs1Oy0RUavI5sWjcwdM59vKYzka.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/2/episode/9"},{"id":"1168887","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Dr. Ver arms Miku with a Symphogear, both in order to raise Frontier and defeat the wielders. His use of LiNKER means that any serious shocks could kill her. Hibiki tries to stop her, but she only has two minutes and forty seconds before the overload from her Gear kills her as well.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-09-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3BxHtoIriHC8Qcadh8sKJ4BH9Sl.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3BxHtoIriHC8Qcadh8sKJ4BH9Sl.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/2/episode/10"},{"id":"1168888","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11"